WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Very well... Continue your invasion.

2
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:30.000
We are happy to demonstrate you the power of order. See. Analyze. Prepare.

3
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:34.000
We should prepare for the worst...

4
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Ahem... Look at them - they are already running. A wise decision!

5
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:46.000
I will try to open the portal... But only Tensess knows what is waiting for us on the other side!

6
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Let it be so. The faster we attack, the more often the enemy fails!

7
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:54.000
But we don't have the right to make mistakes...
